## 1. CAD tools and game car practice
**Common pattern.** Every CAD tool surfaces a 4-sided (sometimes 3-sided) loop with per-edge continuity, and a shared edge is one curve, so neighbours weld by construction. Rhino NetworkSrf needs two curve families where every U curve crosses every V curve, always smooths its output, and has edge, interior and angle tolerances plus G0/G1/G2 matching [1]; edges can miss tolerance when inputs lack curvature continuity [2]. Alias Square blends four boundary curves with per-edge G0/G1/G2, a Linear ( [...]

